by is readmitted to the NlCU', 0.986621534196954], [[[180.0, 1196.0], [713.0, 1196.0], [713.0, 1222.0], [180.0, 1222.0]], 'fromhome,nofurtherdatawillbecollected.', 0.9959709848228254], [[[179.0, 1255.0], [887.0, 1256.0], [886.0, 1286.0], [179.0, 1285.0]], '4.2.2TransfertoAnotherLocationwithintheCenter', 0.9964308381080628], [[[179.0, 1329.0], [1347.0, 1330.0], [1347.0, 1360.0], [179.0, 1359.0]], 'hospital within the same clinical center, the coordinator is still expected to keep track of the baby', 0.9791755092025983], [[[181.0, 1362.0], [1069.0, 1362.0], [1069.0, 1392.0], [181.0, 1392.0]], 'and complete form NG03 when the baby finally leaves the clinical center.', 0.962592831088437], [[[179.0, 1424.0], [632.0, 1426.0], [631.0, 1456.0], [179.0, 1454.0]], '4.2.3TransfertoAnotherFacility', 0.995962913831075], [[[181.0, 1468.0], [1345.0, 1468.0], [1345.0, 1494.0], [181.0, 1494.0]], 'TheNetworkCoordinatorshouldattempttodeterminethefinaloutcome(deathordischarge)for', 0.9926831582446157], [[[181.0, 1499.0], [1220.0, 1499.0], [1220.0, 1528.0], [181.0, 1528.0]], 'eachbaby that is transferred out of the clinical centerto another facility.If an infant is', 0.9435357405079736], [[[178.0, 1531.0], [1262.0, 1533.0], [1262.0, 1562.0], [178.0, 1560.0]], 'transferred back within 7 days (without being discharged to home), do not count this as a', 0.9773105610622449], [[[179.0, 1564.0], [763.0, 1566.0], [763.0, 1595.0], [179.0, 1593.0]], 'dischargebut rather as a continuous admission.', 0.9715286026830259], [[[179.0, 1611.0], [1278.0, 1612.0], [1278.0, 1641.0], [179.0, 1640.0]], 'Transfer to another NRN Center does not meet the NRN definition of transfer (status). The', 0.9843845039271237], [[[178.0, 1643.0], [1317.0, 1641.0], [1317.0, 1671.0], [178.0, 1673.0]], 'following procedures should be followed to document a transfer between NRN Centers and to', 0.9960391146413395], [[[179.0, 1675.0], [1303.0, 1674.0], [1303.0, 1703.0], [179.0, 1704.0]], 'allowfor complete and accurate collec